@ 
@ Constants:
@ - EQUIP_SLOT_BASE=0x0201c510 (equip slot array base, DWORD_08079f48)
@ - PLAYER_STRIDE=0x868 (per-player stride, DWORD_08079f44)
@ - SLOT_ENTRY_SIZE=20 (bytes per slot entry)
@ - COUNT_BITS=[29:24] (equip count bit-field, lsls#2/lsrs#0x18)
@ - ACTIVE_BIT=bit13 (lsls#0x12/lsrs#0x1f)
